WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.850
Apple made the top three
in every comparison.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.720
Not one ranked it first.

3
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:08.180
In Recoscope's November eighth
wireless-earbuds snapshot,

4
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.280
eleven usable answers
came from twelve prompts.

5
00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:14.220
Apple appeared in
seven of eleven answers.

6
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.400
Across the four
comparative rankings,

7
00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:18.450
it made the top three four times,

8
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.420
and ranked first zero times.

9
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:23.740
Gemini placed Apple and Samsung
together at second.

10
00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.220
So who came first?

11
00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:26.600
Sony twice.

12
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.150
Jabra once.

13
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.560
Bose once.

14
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.060
Sony also led overall mentions,

15
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.600
appearing in eight of eleven
usable answers.

16
00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:37.700
For brand owners,
being consistently shortlisted

17
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.920
isn't the same as
being the first choice.

18
00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:43.060
Captured answers,
not product-quality ratings.

19
00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:46.200
Explore benchmark at
getrecoscope.com.
